{"id":"e174b0a1a0ce73b6","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos.md","title":"Theorem — 有穷几何理论的相干分类拓扑斯","display":"Theorem — 有穷几何理论的相干分类拓扑斯","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos","aliases":["14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos"],"display":"Theorem — 有穷几何理论的相干分类拓扑斯","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]","[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]","[[14-thm-existence-classifying-topos]]","[[14-df-classifying-topos]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 有穷几何理论的相干分类拓扑斯"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37f646888720f3eb\" href=\"?note=37f646888720f3eb\" title=\"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi\">14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"870f44eeb18d8969\" href=\"?note=870f44eeb18d8969\" title=\"14-thm-existence-classifying-topos\">14-thm-existence-classifying-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" href=\"?note=a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" title=\"14-df-classifying-topos\">14-df-classifying-topos</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a> 的有穷几何理论；相干性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"37f646888720f3eb\" href=\"?note=37f646888720f3eb\" title=\"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi\">14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi</a> 的有限型站点定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathcal B\\ (\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B,\\mathbb T)\\land\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathcal B\\ (\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B,\\mathbb T)\\land\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.11 p.519 及 X.5–6。语法范畴有有限极限，语法覆盖由有限几何析取生成，故给出有限覆盖族基，满足<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"37f646888720f3eb\" href=\"?note=37f646888720f3eb\" title=\"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi\">14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi</a>。该结论依赖<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"99e83f097dc38c76\" href=\"?note=99e83f097dc38c76\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula\">14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</a>采用原书有穷片段；对现代任意无穷析取几何理论不能直接沿用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-theory-models","status":"resolved","id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi","status":"resolved","id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-existence-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"870f44eeb18d8969","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-existence-classifying-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-classifying-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-theory-models","status":"resolved","id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 的有穷几何理论；相干性采用 [[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]] 的有限型站点定义。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi","status":"resolved","id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 的有穷几何理论；相干性采用 [[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]] 的有限型站点定义。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi","status":"resolved","id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 IX.11 p.519 及 X.5–6。语法范畴有有限极限，语法覆盖由有限几何析取生成，故给出有限覆盖族基，满足[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]。该结论依赖[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]采用原书有穷片段；对现代任意无穷析取几何理论不能直接沿用。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula","status":"resolved","id":"99e83f097dc38c76","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 IX.11 p.519 及 X.5–6。语法范畴有有限极限，语法覆盖由有限几何析取生成，故给出有限覆盖族基，满足[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]。该结论依赖[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]采用原书有穷片段；对现代任意无穷析取几何理论不能直接沿用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb T","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathcal B\\ (\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B,\\mathbb T)\\land\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal B)).","display":true}],"bytes":1153,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos|Theorem — 有穷几何理论的相干分类拓扑斯]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos|Theorem — 有穷几何理论的相干分类拓扑斯]]"},{"id":"0ed40e4b73b2ad9a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"精确来源：原书 X.7 Corollary 2，印刷 p.569，并结合语法推导判据。分类拓扑斯可相干呈现（[[14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos]]），Deligne 定理给足够多点；各点将泛模型拉回为集合模型。若所有集合模型满足，则点反射泛模型中子对象包含，再由[[14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness]]得到可导。只适用于这里的有穷几何片段。"}],"outgoing":["b995af55a8b210ce","37f646888720f3eb","870f44eeb18d8969","a76b2bc2c7b718cf","99e83f097dc38c76"]}